  "body": "## Summary\n- Control Tower submits `run_coding` with account, model, and provider (`claude`, `codex`, `cursor`, `antigravity`).\n- Envelope matches the Kernel CLI shape. The six UNKNOWN surfaces stay unlabeled.\n- Vitest remains 184 with the existing identity digest.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `nvm use 22.23.2 && npm test` \u2014 184 passed\n- [ ] Hosted Portal CI after this source-only PR\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
